@format 1
@id relay.select-target
@title Select relay target
@area Relay
@entry input
@summary Select or clear the target tab that should receive output from newly created work.
@flow TB
@related relay.deliver-output

@alias action = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAction

[input] Relay menu selection <input>
- Receive a target-tab or None selection @ action.PActionRelaySelect(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply relay target <process>
- Store the selected target identifier and publish target change @ action.PActionRelayApply(...)
- Refresh relay button icon, text, and active state @ action.PActionFaceUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Relay target selected <output>
= Subsequent work descriptions carry the selected output relay target.
